#: ckanext/schemingdcat/templates/schemingdcat/endpoints/index.html:21
msgid ""
"Endpoints are access points to an API that allow interaction between "
"different software systems. In the context of CKAN, endpoints are essential "
"for enabling access to the data and metadata stored on the platform."
