"This endpoint allows access to data in RDF (Resource Description Framework) "
"format, a standard for data exchange on the web."
msgstr ""

#: ckanext/schemingdcat/templates/schemingdcat/endpoints/index.html:27
msgid ""
"This endpoint provides data in Turtle format, a compact and easy-to-read "
"syntax for RDF."
msgstr ""

#: ckanext/schemingdcat/templates/schemingdcat/endpoints/index.html:28
msgid ""
"This endpoint offers data in JSON-LD format, a representation of RDF data in "
"JSON that allows interoperability between different data services."
msgstr ""

